      </span><div class="folder" id="folder28"><div class="line"><span class="folder-button fold"></span><span class="html-tag">&lt;author&gt;</span></div><div class="opened"><div class="line"><span>&lt;![CDATA[ Vaile, John R.; Connolly, William C.; Zavitsanos, Alexander P.; Isch, Emily L.; Zavodnick, Jillian H.; Tannouri, Sami; McMahon, Heather A. ]]&gt;</span></div></div><span class="folded hidden">...</span><div class="line"><span class="html-tag">&lt;/author&gt;</span></div></div><span>
